agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06-fable-field-guide/changes/insights/Blindspot passes on program plans surface plan-integrity gaps like expired gates and unowned decisions that risk registers cannot list.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06-fable-field-guide/changes/insights/Decision registers without decision-by dates convert silence into invisible schedule risk.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06-fable-field-guide/changes/insights/Deliberately divergent throwaway prototypes surface tacit taste more cheaply than iterating on a single design.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06-fable-field-guide/changes/insights/Implementation plans ordered by likelihood of change let humans veto expensive decisions while they are still cheap.md
