agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/AI copyright risk has split into separate battles over training use dataset provenance and output liability rather than one fair-use question.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/AI without standards-grounded playbooks accelerates inconsistency rather than improving legal output quality.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Abstract document QA benchmarks must score topic coverage and unsupported content because synthesis failures hide behind fluent answers.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Agentic systems must clear a five-part proof standard of value risk control cost and adoption before earning the right to scale.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Byte-exact chunk deduplication reduces enterprise RAG context cost without changing answers when redundancy is the failure mode.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Cedar policy language intercepts every agent tool call as a deterministic pre-execution gate ensuring security decisions never depend on LLM reasoning.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Claim-level coherence checks can repair retrieval-augmented legal reasoning before final-answer hallucinations harden.md
agentic-vault-ops/passes/2026-07-06/changes/insights/Context governance must version provenance and reconstruct source state before legal agents retrieve evidence.md
